<title>USA: PHLX to list Friedman's options March 13.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list Friedman's options March 13.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange said Tuesday it would open trading in options on shares of jewelry retailer Friedman's Inc on March 13.</p>
<p>The exchange said Friedman's options would open with strike prices of 15, 17-1/2 and 20 and initial expirations in April, May, August and September. Position limits have been set at 7,500 contracts.</p>
<p>The stock rose 3/8 to 17-1/8 Tuesday.</p>
<p>The PHLX said TFM Investment Gropu has been named the specalist unit. ((Derivatives desk, 3124088750/Email: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
